cient. The steps from the validated source tag to the confirmed checksum and the activation of the consistency check seem to follow the given rules. Therefore, the proposed change is warranted, leading to the answer A. So the judgment is that the reasoning is sufficient.\n</think>\n\n{\"judgment\":\"A\"}",
